{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race, refine, and perfect your driving in <strong>Little Laps</strong>, a minimalist racer that distills the thrill of racing into its simplest, purest form. Navigate handcrafted tracks designed for precision, flow, and endless replayability, each lap challenging you to shave milliseconds off your best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778590/extras/Little_Laps_gif__1_.gif?t=1749229812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MASTER EVERY TRACK</strong> \u2013 With 10 meticulously crafted tracks to conquer, each one brings its own twist and challenge. Find your rhythm, perfect your timing, and chase the ultimate lap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHASE YOUR BEST TIMES</strong> \u2013 Compete against racers from around the globe on integrated online leaderboards, or simply race against your own ghost. Every millisecond counts. Can you set a new record?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ONE BUTTON, ENDLESS DEPTH</strong> \u2013 Experience racing simplicity at its best with intuitive single-button controls. Easy to pick up, yet deeply rewarding to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MINIMALIST STYLE, MAXIMUM FLOW</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in sleek visuals, smooth gameplay, and a calming aesthetic. Racing has never felt so refined.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Content </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains 3 tracks, 18 achievements, and 5 cars to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Greens III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778590/d7651a544ed5331f4e36c8e729aafc43dc589d35.jpg"},{"name":"Greens II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3778590/47f990b8883d4b3dda0fa2aa2153517d5c914596.jpg"},{"name":"Greens I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm